This file is the carve-out list the root `LICENSE` points at. It records three things: which files
in this repository are not under `LicenseRef-zkasuran-SAND-1.0`, which third-party components the
app depends on and under what terms, then what is published versus restored.

Every licence named below was read from the component's own bytes in `node_modules/<pkg>/` or from
its published package, not from memory. Where a licence could not be read, the entry says so.

## Files in this repository that are not SAND-1.0

