## Third-party components

None of these are redistributed in this repository. `node_modules/`, `contracts/lib/` and the build
output are all gitignored, so a clone carries manifests and lockfiles and restores the dependencies
rather than receiving copies of them. They are named here because the app is served to the public and
their terms travel with what is served.

